at "/demo/chessboard"

// The web host gives a surface no touches: the rules (perft, castling, en passant, promotion,
// mate, stalemate), the drag, the tap, the clocks, the aura and the review card are the Rust tests'
// (gpu/src/chessboard.rs, gpu/src/chessboard/chess.rs); here what the Contract holds.
test "the canvas fills the screen"
  expect tree has "chessboard"
  expect tree has "chessboard-canvas"

// The bar shows once the surface posts its puzzle mode: a build without the puzzle (and the web,
// whose host hears no surface message) never does.
test "the puzzle bar waits for the surface"
  expect tree missing "puzzle-bar"
